WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.840
Emerald Sprawl is answering back.

2
00:00:04.840 --> 00:00:09.680
Recovery crews pushed Rust Bazaar into the public frame, Ghostline is sorting rumor from dispatch, and faction confidence is moving.

3
00:00:09.680 --> 00:00:14.520
The board closes with one warning: hesitation is now visible, and the next turn will not wait politely.

4
00:00:14.520 --> 00:00:19.360
The point is not to summarize everything.

5
00:00:19.360 --> 00:00:24.200
The point is to give the table a public pulse: what changed, who noticed, and which pressure is about to become playable.
